<title>USA: Covenant sets four pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Covenant sets four pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HADDONFIELD, N.J. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covenant Bank said Wednesday it would issue a four percent stock dividend following the formation of a bank holding company, announced in December.</p>
</text>
